EXPENSIVE HINT#3

MISSION #2 IS VERY EASY. JUST STAND ON THE CROWN OF A PHOENIX. ALL
YOU HAVE TO DO IS FIND THE PHOENIX. NO PROBLEM. YOU PROBABLY KNOW
WHERE IT IS ALREADY. JUST IN CASE YOU DON'T:

REMEMBER THAT BIG RED AND YELLOW TENT SOUTH OF THE DUNGEON OF
SACRIFICE. JUST ENTERING IT WILL BE PLAINLY OBVIOUS OF WHAT YOU
HAVE TO DO. THERE IS A LARGE PHOENIX IN THE FLOOR OF THE TENT.
GO STAND ON THE CROWN. YOU WILL GET THE MISSION COMPLETE SIGNAL.

THERE ARE A FEW THINGS OF VALUE IN THE SOUTHWESTERN ROOM OF THIS
TENT BUT BEWARE THE GIANT SCORPIONS. IF YOU CAN GET INTO THE MIDDLE
OF THE GARDEN THEN TAKE NOTE OF WHAT YOU SEE. IT MIGHT BE IMPORTANT
(IN THE REGISTERED VERSION).